Ladybird reads an empty handler name when an MP4 track has no name
bytes. Chromium does the same in HandlerReference::Parse(). Gecko’s
mp4parse read_hdlr() accepts the missing terminator in permissive
mode and reports an error at higher strictness. WebKit delegates URL
assets to AVFoundation in createAVAssetForURL(). Its source doesn’t
establish how AVFoundation handles an empty track name.
